  - statementId: 9
    basicConversation:
    - id: 9
      conversation: 18 years ago, I joined the team of meteor fall investigation. At that time, I thought it is just natural phenomenon. Who would thought that it will upside down our knowledge of science? Since we couldn't progress on investigation, the team was disbanded. After 1 year from first investigation, the team was reorganized... Then I found it.. The crack of time space..
