      conversation: And the foundation of great geometry theory was completed. Unfortunately before this theory had been completed, there were already lots of experiments with its branched theory. The one of them is D Engine which was developed for airplane. It can compress the time  space and reduce the travel time. The prototype had no problem but at the last testing of manufactured engine , the whole air-plain was disappeared suddenly.
